## Phase 3 — Refactor [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py)

After the MCP client is in place, these sections of [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py) become thin wrappers:

| Before | After |
|--------|-------|
| [index_text](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#192-310): 60 lines of chunking + SQLAlchemy insert | Chunking stays, then one `await pgvector_client.upsert_embeddings(rows)` |
| [delete_document](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#312-323): 8 lines of SQLAlchemy ORM | `await pgvector_client.delete_by_source(filename, user_id)` |
| [retrieve_context](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#805-1007) vector search block: 15 lines | `await pgvector_client.vector_search(user_id, embedding, limit=20)` |
| [get_bm25](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#768-803): 30 lines loading all docs from DB | `await pgvector_client.fetch_all_for_user(user_id)` then build BM25 |
| [find_associative_memories](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#132-187) theme-loop DB queries | `await pgvector_client.vector_search(...)` per theme |

Estimated line reduction in [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py): **~200 lines removed**, replaced by typed client calls.

SQLAlchemy's [BrainEmbedding](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/models/models.py#50-57) model and its raw ORM queries in [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py) can be removed entirely — the model stays in [models.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/models/models.py) for Alembic migration history but the ORM is no longer the query path.

