## Estimated Effort

| Phase | Work | Estimate |
|-------|------|----------|
| Phase 1: MCP server `server.py` + `db.py` | New service, 5 endpoints | 2–3 hrs |
| Phase 2: `client.py` async httpx wrapper | 1 file | 30 min |
| Phase 3: [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py) refactor | Replace ORM calls with client calls | 2 hrs |
| Phase 4: Router cleanup | Remove [db](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/core/database.py#22-28) param threading | 30 min |
| Phase 5: Docker + testing | Update compose, integration tests | 1 hr |

**Total: ~6–7 hours of focused work**

