## Verification Plan (When We Implement)

1. **Unit test the MCP server endpoints** — pytest hitting `server.py` directly with a test DB
2. **Integration test [rag_engine.py](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py)** — [async_index_text](file:///Users/siddhanttomar/development/flutter_projects/brain_dump/brain-dump/backend/app/services/rag_engine.py#1062-1076) → `vector_search` cycle, assert correct chunk count and retrieval
3. **Run existing backend tests**: `cd backend && pytest tests/ -v`
4. **Manual smoke test**: Upload a `.md` file via Flutter app, ask a question, verify the answer surfaces content from that file
